## Recommended Actions Before Deploy

```bash
# 1. Fix all auto-patchable vulnerabilities:
npm audit fix              # Node.js
pip-audit --fix            # Python

# 2. Re-run full audit to confirm clean state:
./tools/audit.sh

# 3. Generate updated stay_safe.md:
./tools/stay-safe-gen.sh .vibesafe/summary.json

# 4. Set up ongoing monitoring:
# Add Dependabot (.github/dependabot.yml) or Renovate (renovate.json)

# 5. Before production deploy — mandatory:
npm audit --audit-level=high    # Fail if high+ CVEs remain
pip-audit --strict              # Fail if any vulns remain
```

